sequenceDiagram
    participant ODHOp as ODH Operator
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    participant FMO as feast-module-operator<br/>ServiceAccount token
    participant FS as Local Filesystem<br/>Bundled Manifests

    rect rgb(230, 245, 255)
        Note over ODHOp,FMO: Flow 1: FeastOperator Reconciliation
        ODHOp->>K8sAPI: Create FeastOperator CR<br/>(default-feastoperator, cluster-scoped)
        K8sAPI-->>FMO: Watch event: FeastOperator created
        FMO->>FS: Read bundled kustomize manifests<br/>(ODH or RHOAI overlay)
        FS-->>FMO: Raw manifests + params.env
        FMO->>FMO: Inject RELATED_IMAGE_* and<br/>OIDC_ISSUER_URL into params.env
        FMO->>FMO: Render kustomize manifests<br/>(platform-specific overlay)
        FMO->>K8sAPI: Apply rendered manifests<br/>(Deployment, RBAC, CRDs, ServiceMonitor)
        K8sAPI-->>FMO: Apply result
        FMO->>K8sAPI: Update FeastOperator status<br/>(conditions + release version)
    end

    rect rgb(255, 245, 230)
        Note over ODHOp,FMO: Flow 2: Platform Version Handshake
        ODHOp->>K8sAPI: Create/Update odh-feastoperator-config<br/>ConfigMap (version info)
        K8sAPI-->>FMO: Watch event: ConfigMap updated<br/>(named predicate filter)
        FMO->>K8sAPI: Read odh-feastoperator-config<br/>(direct read, cache bypassed)
        K8sAPI-->>FMO: ConfigMap data (platform version)
        FMO->>FMO: Compare platform versions<br/>(semver comparison)
        alt Version changed
            FMO->>K8sAPI: Run upgrade migrations<br/>(deployment selector migration, etc.)
            K8sAPI-->>FMO: Migration result
        end
        FMO->>K8sAPI: Update FeastOperator status<br/>(new platform version acknowledged)
    end
